OL,3,AThree children and one teacher killed
OL,4,Aafter 16-year-old opens fire at Oregon
OL,5,Aprimary school
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe suspect was gunned down by an armed
OL,8,Fmember of the community who followed
OL,9,Fthe suspect inside the school, police
OL,10,Fsay
OL,12,FTwo additional victims, a 7-year-old
OL,13,Fand another teacher, were hurt and
OL,14,Ftransported to hospital. They are both
OL,15,Fin critical condition
OL,17,FLives have been "forever changed" by
OL,18,Fthis tragedy, Oregon Governor Tina
OL,19,FKotek says
